#basePath	Day1


:: OpeningCutscene
@trigger SceneReady
@who    IntroCutscene
$call SetInputState(false)
$call StopPuzzleMode()
$call StopOpenMode()
$call PlayMusic("Music.Gently-Falling", 1)
$call IntroCutscene->BeginCutscene()
$call Wait(2)
$call TelescopeLook(155, -30)

:: ArrivalAtTheShed
@trigger    CutsceneEnd
@when cutsceneId == "IntroCutscene"
@who    Radio

$call PlayMusic("Music.Gently-Falling-Piano", 1)

$call Wait(2)

{@Radio} Star HQ to Station Seven. Elijah, do you copy?
$call MoveToView("Right")
{@Radio} Please log in and provide status update. 

$call Wait(2)

{@Astrid} Hi—um, this is Astrid, Elijah’s ... friend. Elijah doesn't seem to be here.
$call Wait(1)
{@Astrid} Hello?
$call Wait(1)
{@Astrid} Ugh. They can’t hear me.
$call Wait(2)

{@Radio} Station Seven, please log in and report.

$call Wait(1)

{@Astrid} I can’t, I don’t know how ...

$call Wait(2)


{@Dad} Hold on. 
$call Wait(1)
We just recieved a neutrino emission from the Ursa Major region. Station Seven, please confirm that you are able to help. 

$call Wait(2)
{@Astrid} ... I might as well help while I wait to see if Elijah shows up. 
$call Wait(1)

Uploading area of interest... (*neutrino upload noises*)

$call WaitForMovedToView("Desk")
$call StartNeutrinoNavigation()
$call SetInputState(true)
$call StopMusic(2)

:: NeutrinoNavigationComplete
@trigger    NeutrinoNavigationComplete
@once

{@Radio} Neutrino Origin Detected
$call StopNeutrinoNavigation()
$call StartOpenMode()

:: PointsUpdated
@trigger    PointsUpdated
@when   sciencePoints > 2
@once

$call StopOpenMode()
$call ClearMonitorSelection()
{@Radio} Star HQ to Station Seven.
The STAR Coalition has requests your assistance identifying starts in the Perseus constellation.
Please align your telescope to the Perseus region. 
$call StartPuzzleNavigation()

:: PuzzleNavigationComplete
@trigger    PuzzleNavigationComplete
@once

$call StopPuzzleNavigation()
{@Radio} This task will require your astral color instrument. 
{@Radio} Unlocking now. Stand By...


{@Dad} Have you made any progress on Project Hercules? Those puzzles are really important. Please don't lose focus. 
$call Wait(2)

{@Astrid} Project Hercules? 
$call Wait(1)


{@Dad} Keep following the reference guide.

{@Dad} Time’s up. I'll log on again at the next click. Keep up the good work. 
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(ColorInstrument, true)
$call StartPuzzleMode()

:: PerseusPuzzleComplete
@trigger    CorrectPuzzleSubmission
@when   puzzleName == "Perseus"
@once

$call ClearMonitorSelection()
$call StopPuzzleMode()
$call SetInputState(false)
{@Astrid} Time to turn in for the night.
Oh, what's this?
$call WaitForMovedToView("Left")
$call SpawnDocumentToCamera("Day1Martha")
$call SetInputState(true)

:: EndDay
@trigger    DocumentInspectEnd
@when   documentId == "Day1Martha"
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
$call Wait(1)
$call LoadNextDay()